  "rationale": "Polymarket emits tick_size_change events when an active market moves into or out of an extreme-price regime, and the venue rejects order prices that do not conform to the active tick size. The frozen replay quantized candidate limits with static market metadata and did not revalidate the limit against the execution book's active tick. This correction uses the causally reconstructed decision tick, validates every recorded price lattice, and refuses fill credit when the execution-time lattice no longer accepts the limit.",
